    "created_at": "2021-01-11T19:52:14Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-01-11T19:52:14Z",
    "body": "From what I can tell conditional formatting in the main `format` option (outside of any modules) only doesn't display when the included modules are actually disabled, rather than blank, which isn't very helpful because if someone edited their config to disable a module they might as well just delete that section of their `format` string.",
