    "created_at": "2021-05-11T20:58:34Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-05-11T20:58:34Z",
    "body": "For anyone who comes across this, I was able to work around this issue by adding the additional text I wanted to the format of the last module in the group. However, given that I think this would be a good thing to add, and that my workaround only works if all of the modules relate to the same thing (in my case git repositories), I'm keeping this issue open.",
